OL,12,     FUK's energy system.
OL,13,G1630 Soul Music
OL,14,     FLandslide was written by Stevie
OL,15,     FNicks in 1973 on the cusp of huge
OL,16,     Fchange in her life. For many, it
OL,17,     Fhas become an anthem of quiet
OL,18,     Fcourage and acceptance in the face
OL,19,     Fof passing time.
